# Semantic HTML

- Use `<main>`, `<article>`, `<section>`, `<nav>`, `<header>`, `<footer>`
- One `<h1>` per page (typically in Hero block)
- Do not skip heading levels (h1 → h2 → h3)
- Images require meaningful `alt` text
- Use `aria-labelledby` on sections when heading provides the label

Brand guide at `/brand` uses `noindex` — still follow semantic structure.
